 "text": "TRIPP COUNTY - Tripp County South Dakota\nTRIPP COUNTY\nHome\nABOUT\nDIRECTORY\nCOMMISSIONERS\nNOTICES/BIDS\nEmployment\nWelcome to Tripp County\nLike us on facebook!\nItems to Note\nTreasurer Note:\n​In the month of October, the second half of property taxes are due.\n​\nAuditor Note:\n|\nCalendar of Events\n*Calendar events are subject to change. If you have questions please contact the office directly to verify.\n​Driver's License Renewal & Exam\nThey are onsite weekly on Friday in the Community Room on the first floor of the Court House.\n​\nFor more information regarding drivers licensing info for the\n​State of South Dakota click here .\n|\n​​\nCourt House Hours:\n​ * Some offices are only open certain days. Please visit the office directory page for specific office hours.\n​\nFollow us on Facebook!\nSite powered by Weebly. Managed by HostCentric\nHome\nABOUT\nDIRECTORY\nAmbulance Billing & Welfare\nCounty Auditor\nClerk of Court\nEqualization Office\nExtension Office\n>\nTripp County Fair Board\nHighway Department\nRegister Of Deeds\nSheriff\nState Attorney\nTreasurer\nTripp County Ambulance\nTripp County Library Grossenburg Memorial\nVeteran Services\nWeed & Pest Management\nCOMMISSIONERS\nAgenda\nTripp County Minutes\nNOTICES/BIDS\nEmployment\nAmbulance Billing & Welfare\nCounty Auditor\nClerk of Court\nEqualization Office\nExtension Office\n>\nTripp County Fair Board\nHighway Department\nRegister Of Deeds\nSheriff\nState Attorney\nTreasurer\nTripp County Ambulance\nTripp County Library Grossenburg Memorial\nVeteran Services\nWeed & Pest Management\nAgenda\nTripp County Minutes",
